  "properties": {
    "title": "Random Geodata Generator",
    "description": "For developing geospatial applications often some sample data of a specific region is needed. This lightning talks presents a web application that allows to create random vector data of a required extent. The data can be exported as GeoJSON or Shapefile and runs completely in the browser without any connection to a backend. The application itself is created with Vue.js and OpenLayers. The source code and the website are freely available.",
